{"id":"812378a7c13a40e3","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse.md","title":"ZFC Inner4 Active Premouse","display":"df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse — ZFC Inner4 Active Premouse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse"],"display":"df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse — ZFC Inner4 Active Premouse","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse — ZFC Inner4 Active Premouse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1048d44b28527ff2\" href=\"?note=1048d44b28527ff2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,M,\\vec E,\\lambda,\\beta\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,M,\\vec E,\\lambda,\\beta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1048d44b28527ff2\" href=\"?note=1048d44b28527ff2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}active\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\land\\exists M,\\vec E,\\lambda,\\beta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E)=\\lambda\\land\\lambda=\\beta+1\\land\\vec E(\\beta)\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}active\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\land\\exists M,\\vec E,\\lambda,\\beta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E)=\\lambda\\land\\lambda=\\beta+1\\land\\vec E(\\beta)\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Activity is tied to the coded premouse data: the extender sequence has successor length and its top entry is nonempty.  This replaces the previously undeclared projection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^M\">\\(F^M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"